<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Tuesday&apos;s Gone"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lynyrd Skynyrd"/><amll:meta key="album" value="(pronounced &apos;lĕh-&apos;nérd &apos;skin-&apos;nérd)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM72304639"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USMC17347089"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="21052182"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="6:08.843"><div begin="41.365" end="6:08.843"><p begin="41.365" end="48.840" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.365" end="42.272">Train</span> <span begin="42.272" end="42.522">roll</span> <span begin="42.522" end="43.647">on,</span> <span begin="45.584" end="46.819">on</span> <span begin="46.819" end="47.502">down</span> <span begin="47.502" end="47.610">the</span> <span begin="47.610" end="48.840">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">列车就这样沿着铁轨不断前行</span></p><p begin="49.295" end="57.892" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.295" end="49.625">Won’t</span> <span begin="49.625" end="50.140">you</span> <span begin="51.332" end="51.727">please</span> <span begin="51.727" end="52.124">take</span> <span begin="52.124" end="52.337">me</span> <span begin="52.337" end="53.562">far</span> <span begin="54.747" end="54.962">a</span><span begin="54.962" end="57.892">way?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你愿意带着我一起飘向远方么？</span></p><p begin="1:00.783" end="1:08.579" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.783" end="1:00.923">Now</span> <span begin="1:00.923" end="1:01.088">I</span> <span begin="1:01.088" end="1:01.658">feel</span> <span begin="1:01.658" end="1:01.809">the</span> <span begin="1:01.809" end="1:02.186">wind</span> <span begin="1:02.186" end="1:03.676">blow</span> <span begin="1:05.266" end="1:06.509">out</span><span begin="1:06.509" end="1:06.976">side</span> <span begin="1:06.976" end="1:07.189">my</span> <span begin="1:07.189" end="1:08.579">door</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此时此刻我听着门外凛冽的风声</span></p><p begin="1:10.858" end="1:18.371" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.858" end="1:10.858">Means</span> <span begin="1:10.858" end="1:11.083">I’m</span> <span begin="1:11.083" end="1:11.798">lea</span><span begin="1:11.798" end="1:11.939">ving</span> <span begin="1:11.939" end="1:12.330">my</span> <span begin="1:12.330" end="1:13.195">woman</span> <span begin="1:14.768" end="1:14.925">at</span> <span begin="1:14.925" end="1:18.371">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或许这意味着我将离开我心爱的姑娘</span></p><p begin="1:20.817" end="1:26.526" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.817" end="1:21.670">Tues</span><span begin="1:21.670" end="1:22.057">day’s</span> <span begin="1:22.057" end="1:23.947">gone</span> <span begin="1:23.947" end="1:24.312">with</span> <span begin="1:24.312" end="1:24.507">the</span> <span begin="1:24.507" end="1:26.526">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="1:30.684" end="1:37.998" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.684" end="1:30.836">My</span> <span begin="1:30.836" end="1:31.379">babe</span> <span begin="1:31.379" end="1:31.683">is</span> <span begin="1:31.683" end="1:32.969">gone</span> <span begin="1:33.858" end="1:34.028">with</span> <span begin="1:34.028" end="1:34.216">the</span> <span begin="1:34.216" end="1:37.998">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的女孩也离我远去</span></p><p begin="1:59.820" end="2:07.728" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.820" end="2:00.005">And</span> <span begin="2:00.005" end="2:00.298">I</span> <span begin="2:00.298" end="2:01.070">don’t</span> <span begin="2:01.070" end="2:02.621">know</span> <span begin="2:05.398" end="2:05.845">where</span> <span begin="2:05.845" end="2:06.290">I’m</span> <span begin="2:06.290" end="2:06.658">go</span><span begin="2:06.658" end="2:07.728">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可是我依然糊涂万分不知路在何方</span></p><p begin="2:09.734" end="2:16.990" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.734" end="2:09.936">I</span> <span begin="2:09.936" end="2:10.313">just</span> <span begin="2:10.313" end="2:10.773">want</span> <span begin="2:10.773" end="2:10.956">to</span> <span begin="2:10.956" end="2:11.883">be</span> <span begin="2:12.843" end="2:13.116">left</span> <span begin="2:13.116" end="2:13.373">a</span><span begin="2:13.373" end="2:16.990">lone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有时候我只是想独自一人</span></p><p begin="2:19.302" end="2:27.252" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.302" end="2:19.490">Well,</span> <span begin="2:19.490" end="2:19.702">when</span> <span begin="2:19.702" end="2:20.052">this</span> <span begin="2:20.052" end="2:20.785">train</span> <span begin="2:20.785" end="2:22.315">ends</span> <span begin="2:23.991" end="2:25.042">I’ll</span> <span begin="2:25.042" end="2:25.662">try</span> <span begin="2:25.662" end="2:25.890">a</span><span begin="2:25.890" end="2:27.252">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好吧，列车停止的那一刻我将再次前行</span></p><p begin="2:29.355" end="2:37.019" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.355" end="2:29.355">But</span> <span begin="2:29.355" end="2:29.567">I’m</span> <span begin="2:29.567" end="2:30.205">lea</span><span begin="2:30.205" end="2:30.372">ving</span> <span begin="2:30.372" end="2:30.654">my</span> <span begin="2:30.654" end="2:31.335">woman</span> <span begin="2:32.984" end="2:33.229">at</span> <span begin="2:33.229" end="2:37.019">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">原谅我把心爱的女孩留在空荡的家里</span></p><p begin="2:39.253" end="2:45.458" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.253" end="2:40.040">Tues</span><span begin="2:40.040" end="2:40.485">day’s</span> <span begin="2:40.485" end="2:42.393">gone</span> <span begin="2:42.501" end="2:42.683">with</span> <span begin="2:42.683" end="2:42.878">the</span> <span begin="2:42.878" end="2:45.458">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="2:48.743" end="2:55.211" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.743" end="2:49.616">Tues</span><span begin="2:49.616" end="2:50.049">day’s</span> <span begin="2:50.049" end="2:51.887">gone</span> <span begin="2:52.119" end="2:52.219">with</span> <span begin="2:52.219" end="2:52.414">the</span> <span begin="2:52.414" end="2:55.211">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="2:58.257" end="3:04.372" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:58.257" end="2:59.124">Tues</span><span begin="2:59.124" end="2:59.557">day’s</span> <span begin="2:59.557" end="3:01.529">gone</span> <span begin="3:01.617" end="3:01.784">with</span> <span begin="3:01.784" end="3:01.967">the</span> <span begin="3:01.967" end="3:04.372">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="3:07.815" end="3:14.156" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:07.815" end="3:08.109">My</span> <span begin="3:08.109" end="3:08.546">ba</span><span begin="3:08.546" end="3:08.961">be’s</span> <span begin="3:08.961" end="3:10.121">gone</span> <span begin="3:10.988" end="3:11.201">with</span> <span begin="3:11.201" end="3:11.381">the</span> <span begin="3:11.381" end="3:14.156">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的女孩也离我远去</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:14.953" end="3:17.865"><span begin="3:14.953" end="3:15.668">(Train</span> <span begin="3:15.668" end="3:16.155">roll</span> <span begin="3:16.155" end="3:17.865">on)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">列车继续前行</span></span></p><p begin="4:52.259" end="4:59.596" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:52.259" end="4:52.949">Train</span> <span begin="4:52.949" end="4:53.324">roll</span> <span begin="4:53.324" end="4:54.356">on</span> <span begin="4:56.671" end="4:56.924">ma</span><span begin="4:56.924" end="4:57.031">ny</span> <span begin="4:57.031" end="4:57.914">miles</span> <span begin="4:57.914" end="4:58.194">from</span> <span begin="4:58.194" end="4:58.669">my</span> <span begin="4:58.669" end="4:59.596">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这趟列车不知走了多远</span></p><p begin="5:01.687" end="5:08.550" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:01.687" end="5:01.687">See,</span> <span begin="5:01.687" end="5:01.872">I’m</span> <span begin="5:01.872" end="5:02.555">ri</span><span begin="5:02.555" end="5:02.700">ding</span> <span begin="5:02.700" end="5:03.020">my</span> <span begin="5:03.020" end="5:04.717">blues</span> <span begin="5:05.335" end="5:05.562">a</span><span begin="5:05.562" end="5:08.550">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看啊，我带着我浅浅的惆怅慢慢前行</span></p><p begin="5:11.557" end="5:19.350" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:11.557" end="5:11.962">Tues</span><span begin="5:11.962" end="5:12.380">day,</span> <span begin="5:12.380" end="5:12.545">you</span> <span begin="5:12.545" end="5:13.560">see,</span> <span begin="5:15.990" end="5:16.210">she</span> <span begin="5:16.210" end="5:16.830">had</span> <span begin="5:16.830" end="5:17.042">to</span> <span begin="5:17.042" end="5:17.447">be</span> <span begin="5:17.447" end="5:19.350">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知道么，在星期二，她终于自由了</span></p><p begin="5:21.093" end="5:28.523" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:21.093" end="5:21.285">But</span> <span begin="5:21.285" end="5:21.655">some</span><span begin="5:21.655" end="5:22.111">how</span> <span begin="5:22.111" end="5:22.503">I’ve</span> <span begin="5:22.503" end="5:22.876">got</span> <span begin="5:22.876" end="5:23.518">to</span> <span begin="5:24.536" end="5:24.731">car</span><span begin="5:24.731" end="5:24.931">ry</span> <span begin="5:24.931" end="5:28.523">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论如何，我却只能继续我的旅程</span></p><p begin="5:30.786" end="5:36.944" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:30.786" end="5:31.661">Tues</span><span begin="5:31.661" end="5:32.026">day’s</span> <span begin="5:32.026" end="5:33.986">gone</span> <span begin="5:34.029" end="5:34.239">with</span> <span begin="5:34.239" end="5:34.414">the</span> <span begin="5:34.414" end="5:36.944">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="5:40.269" end="5:46.354" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:40.269" end="5:41.075">Tues</span><span begin="5:41.075" end="5:41.452">day’s</span> <span begin="5:41.452" end="5:43.247">gone</span> <span begin="5:43.442" end="5:43.597">with</span> <span begin="5:43.597" end="5:43.790">the</span> <span begin="5:43.790" end="5:46.354">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="5:49.604" end="5:55.536" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:49.604" end="5:50.384">Tues</span><span begin="5:50.384" end="5:50.726">day’s</span> <span begin="5:50.726" end="5:52.714">gone</span> <span begin="5:52.770" end="5:52.982">with</span> <span begin="5:52.982" end="5:53.144">the</span> <span begin="5:53.144" end="5:55.536">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="5:58.786" end="6:05.836" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:58.786" end="5:58.996">My</span> <span begin="5:58.996" end="5:59.551">ba</span><span begin="5:59.551" end="5:59.936">be’s</span> <span begin="5:59.936" end="6:00.941">gone</span> <span begin="6:01.946" end="6:02.066">with</span> <span begin="6:02.066" end="6:02.238">the</span> <span begin="6:02.238" end="6:05.836">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的女孩也离我远去</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="6:05.836" end="6:08.843"><span begin="6:05.836" end="6:06.501">(Train</span> <span begin="6:06.501" end="6:06.921">roll</span> <span begin="6:06.921" end="6:08.843">on)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">列车继续前行</span></span></p></div></body></tt>